  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "A documentation photograph of the verso of a matted Ansel Adams print, exposed on 2008-08-08. The mount carries the printed credit block 'Photograph by Ansel Adams for The American Trust Company', a negative number beginning 1-SF-, a handwritten title beginning 'San Francisco fr...', and a hand-inked annotation 'Wells Fargo Bank,' written over the struck-through word 'THE'. These markings correspond to those recorded in the public Sotheby's catalogue entry for lot 16 of Photographs, sale N08533 (2009)."
    ]
  },
